      "writtenOn": "2024-08-01T14:27:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The resourceProvider here comes from DawnCommandBuffer\u0027s fResourceProvider which comes from [QueueManager](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/skia/src/gpu/graphite/QueueManager.cpp;drc\u003dc1b9831c8c232ab9470645977a18527cfa7bb993;l\u003d57). Unless I\u0027m missing something, it looks like it should be the same as Context\u0027s resourceProvider so it should be from the same thread.",
      "parentUuid": "ea0d24d9_7d38cd93",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 260,
        "startChar": 3,
        "endLine": 260,
        "endChar": 6
      },
      "revId": "f6d3f83e407a738f7eba91e3be06f3b74de638ad",
