      "writtenOn": "2024-08-01T18:11:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I did have a SingleOwner earlier in DawnTexture class in PS#4 but it wasn\u0027t preferred and instead decided to pass it in. I could revert back to that if it is preferred.",
      "parentUuid": "6d600c70_cf083144",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 260,
