      "writtenOn": "2024-08-01T18:26:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Plumbing through the SingleOwner has the same problem as plumbing through a ResourceProvider in order to assert on the single owner. There\u0027s nothing stopping a caller from passing in the Recorder\u0027s singleowner to the call at a future point and that wouldn\u0027t prevent simultaneous races when called with the Context\u0027s singleowner.",
      "parentUuid": "36c87400_b7f2ea09",
